          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "1",
          "shape": [
            "avgspeedbin_rows",
            "operating_mode_rows"
          ],
          "description": "drivecycle.rs:388-401: the schedule-fraction-weighted combination, i.e. the operating-mode distribution of one average-speed bin. This is the VSP/braking classification `BaseRateGenerator` drives itself for Running Exhaust (mod.rs:156-161), and every pollutant-process in this run is on that process."
        },
