          "description": "Whether an exact-regClass `temperatureadjustment` row exists. It does not, and neither does the regClassID-0 wildcard row -- the table is EMPTY in this snapshot -- so `exact_else_wildcard` falls through to the zero-valued default. The two-step precedence is written because `mixed-onroad` demonstrably needed its second step (its EV temperature terms came out 0 with only the exact lookup, and the clamp then returned the right answer for the wrong reason); nothing in THIS fixture distinguishes the two steps, because both miss."
        },
