            "sulfatefractions_rows"
          ],
          "description": "sulfatefractions.SulfatenonECPMFraction: the BASE sulfate share of composite NonECPM, 0.08 on gasoline and E85, 0.05 on pre-2007 diesel and 0.74 from 2007. It is read TWICE and differently -- sulfur-adjusted for pollutant 115, raw for the residue -- which is why the split does not conserve mass.",
