            "sulfatefractions_rows"
          ],
          "description": "sulfatefractions.BaseFuelSulfateFraction: how much of the base sulfate fraction tracks the fuel's sulfur, 0.242 to 0.73 here. Deleting the adjustment it drives moves a cell by a factor of 2.385.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
