            "crankcaseemissionratio_rows"
          ],
          "description": "crankcaseemissionratio.regClassID. 20 on every row this run reaches, and every cohort of source type 21 is regClass 20, so the SQL's `s.regClassID = mwo.regClassID` is an ordinary equi-join at the RATE level and needs none of the collapsed-regClass reconciliation ../moves.rs performs against a worker output (docs/process-pm-exhaust.md 8.4).",
