          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "1",
          "default": 0.0,
          "shape": [
            "fuelformulation_rows"
          ],
          "description": "fuelformulation.sulfurLevel, ppm: 7.15 on formulation 9114 (E10 gasoline), 6.00 on 25003 (biodiesel-blend diesel) and 7.15 on 27002 (E85). NULL-as-zero in MOVES (`coalesce(ff.sulfurLevel, 0)`, reproduced by this column's own default of 0) and non-null on all three here.",
          "update": {
            "kind": "data",
