        {
          "_comment": "J53a, adjust.rs:452-472, and it is LIVE here where `process-airtoxics` had an empty table. Three key pairs -- the supplied FORMULATION, the rate row's own polProcessID and the source type -- and TWO inclusive bands, one on model year and one on age, which is why lib/keys.esm carries `in_inclusive_range` under the shape's own name. The table carries polProcessID 11201 and 12001; only 11201 can match a rate row, and the 12001 rows are applied one stage later by `rt_residueFuelRatio`.",
