          "_comment": "How many (rate row, SUPPLIED formulation) pairs the base-rate general-fuel-ratio lookup reaches. NON-ZERO here, unlike in `process-airtoxics`: the table carries polProcessID 11201 and this run's three liquid formulations, so the lookup lands on the elemental-carbon rate rows of gasoline and E85 from model year 2001 and of diesel through 2006. Counted rather than assumed, and kept apart from the count below because the two fail differently.",
