          "_comment": "sulfate_pm_calculator.rs:838-841, as lib/adjustments.esm's new `fuel_sulfur_sulfate_adjustment`. It multiplies BOTH the sulfate fraction and the water fraction, which is why it is one template: written twice the two could disagree about which end the -1 belongs to.",
