        {
          "_comment": "MOVES's composition of the seven emitted pollutants out of the four `spmOutput2` species, as four SHARE columns rather than as a branch per pollutant. Each is a sum of MOVES's own constant arrays: `PM25_TOTAL_INPUTS` = {EC, residue, sulfate, water} is `rt_totalShare` in all four, `NON_EC_PM_INPUTS` = {residue, sulfate, water} is `rt_isNonECPM` in three of them, `COPIED_SPECIES` puts each of EC, sulfate and water in its own, and PM10 rides on the total. Written this way the composition is four readable lines and the two join-identified pollutants (PM10, organic carbon) fall out as factors rather than as cases.",
