        {
          "_comment": "Both calculators, in one inner product of four terms. Every emitted pollutant of this run is a linear combination of the same four `spmOutput2` species: elemental carbon is the EC term alone, sulfate and water are their own terms alone, NonECPM is the re-sum of three, PM2.5 total is all four, organic carbon is the residue times a speciation fraction, and PM10 is all four times the PM10 ratio. No branch on the pollutant appears here -- the shares carry it -- and no unit divisor applies, because not one of this run's seven pollutants is an energy pollutant.",
