        {
          "id": "seven_pollutant_processes_of_which_exactly_two_are_rated",
          "description": "The rate relation's first factor, and the measurement docs/process-pm-exhaust.md 2.8 rests on. `emissionratebyage` carries 11201 and 11801 and nothing else, so `rt_hasRate` is 1 on those two blocks and 0 on the other five -- while `runspecchainedto` marks SIX of the seven as chain outputs, leaving `run_unchainedPolProcessCount` at 1. TWO rated blocks and ONE unchained pollutant-process: MOVES's chain declaration cannot identify the rated set here, because it is cyclic (11801 <- 11501 and 11501 <- 11801) and records `SulfatePMCalculator`'s NonECPM as both an input and an output. The six pollutant-process keys the chain names are packed from MOVES's own constants and this row's process, and the five identity flags are comparisons between two columns of the same row.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "run_unchainedPolProcessCount",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "run_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "run_chainCycleCount",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 4.0,
              "coords": {
                "run_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 1
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 5
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "rspp_isChainInput",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "runspecpollutantprocess_rows": 6
              }
            },
            {
